{
  "meta": {
    "is_partial": true,
    "description": "결제 방법 선택 섹션 (PC/모바일 반응형) - 환경설정 활성 결제수단을 동적 렌더링"
  },
  "type": "basic",
  "name": "Div",
  "props": { "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-6" },
  "responsive": {
    "portable": {
      "props": { "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-4" }
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "comment": "섹션 헤더",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" },
      "responsive": {
        "portable": {
          "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" }
        }
      },
      "children": [
        { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "credit-card", "className": "text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300" } },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "H2",
          "props": { "className": "text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white" }
            }
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.payment_method"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "결제 방법 선택 카드 (활성화된 결제수단 동적 렌더링)",
      "type": "layout",
      "name": "Grid",
      "props": { "cols": 3, "gap": 4, "className": "mb-4" },
      "responsive": {
        "portable": {
          "props": { "cols": 1, "gap": 3, "className": "mb-3" }
        }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "iteration": {
            "source": "{{(paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.payment_methods ?? []).filter(m => m.is_active && (!m.requires_ios || _global.appConfig?.isIos))}}",
            "item_var": "method",
            "index_var": "methodIdx"
          },
          "props": {
            "type": "button",
            "data-testid": "checkout-payment-method-{{method.id}}",
            "className": "{{_computed.selectedPaymentMethod === method.id ? 'p-4 border-2 border-gray-900 dark:border-white rounded-lg text-left' : 'p-4 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-left hover:border-gray-400 dark:hover:border-gray-500'}}"
          },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": {
                "className": "{{_computed.selectedPaymentMethod === method.id ? 'p-3 border-2 border-gray-900 dark:border-white rounded-lg text-left' : 'p-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-left hover:border-gray-400 dark:hover:border-gray-500'}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-3" },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-2" }
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "comment": "브랜드 마크(색 배지/SVG 로고) — 카탈로그 _cached_brand_mark 가 있는 결제수단(간편결제)만 렌더",
                  "type": "composite",
                  "name": "BrandMark",
                  "if": "{{method._cached_brand_mark}}",
                  "props": {
                    "brandMark": "{{method._cached_brand_mark}}",
                    "size": 40
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": { "size": 32 }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "comment": "브랜드 마크가 없는 결제수단(무통장/카드 등) — 아이콘 폴백",
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Icon",
                  "if": "{{!method._cached_brand_mark}}",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "{{method._cached_icon ?? 'circle-question'}}",
                    "className": "text-4xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": {
                        "name": "{{method._cached_icon ?? 'circle-question'}}",
                        "className": "text-3xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "P",
                      "props": { "className": "font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white" },
                      "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                          "props": { "className": "font-medium text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white" }
                        }
                      },
                      "text": "{{$localized(method._cached_name) ?? method.id}}"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "P",
                      "if": "{{$localized(method._cached_description)}}",
                      "props": { "className": "text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" },
                      "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                          "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" }
                        }
                      },
                      "text": "{{$localized(method._cached_description)}}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "comment": "결제수단 전환 시 이전 수단이 소유하던 입력값을 함께 비운다. 확장 슬롯(현금영수증 등)과 환불계좌 블록은 결제수단 조건부로 언마운트되지만 _local 값은 남으므로, 초기화하지 않으면 무통장에서 입력한 값이 카드 주문 payload 에 그대로 실린다.",
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "sequence",
              "params": {
                "actions": [
                  {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": { "target": "_local.paymentMethod", "value": "{{method.id}}" }
                  },
                  {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": { "target": "_local.checkoutExtraPayload", "value": {} }
                  },
                  {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": { "target": "_local.refundBankCode", "value": "" }
                  },
                  {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": { "target": "_local.refundBankAccount", "value": "" }
                  },
                  {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": { "target": "_local.refundBankHolder", "value": "" }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "카드결제 선택 시 안내",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{_computed.selectedPaymentMethod === 'card'}}",
      "props": { "className": "p-4 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg" },
      "responsive": {
        "portable": {
          "props": { "className": "p-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg" }
        }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": { "className": "text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" }
            }
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.card_payment_info"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "가상계좌 선택 시 안내",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{_computed.selectedPaymentMethod === 'vbank'}}",
      "props": { "className": "p-4 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-lg" },
      "responsive": {
        "portable": {
          "props": { "className": "p-3 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-lg" }
        }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": { "className": "text-sm text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2" },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.vbank_info"
        },
        {
          "comment": "입금 기한 — 서버(OrderProcessingService::resolveAutoCancelDays)와 같은 규칙으로 폴백한다. ?? 는 null/undefined 만 막아 빈 문자열('')이 통과하면 days 가 비어 치환이 스킵되고 '{{days}}' 원문이 그대로 노출된다(실측 2026-08-01). 0/음수/비숫자도 서버가 기본치 3 으로 되돌리므로 화면도 동일 판정을 쓴다.",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": { "className": "text-xs text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.vbank_due_notice|days={{Number(paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.auto_cancel_days) > 0 ? Number(paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.auto_cancel_days) : 3}}"
        },
        {
          "comment": "입금자명 입력",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": { "className": "mt-4" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "mt-3" }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Label",
              "props": { "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1" },
              "text": "$t:shop.checkout.depositor_name"
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Input",
              "props": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "depositor_name",
                "value": "{{_local.depositorName ?? _local.orderer?.name ?? ''}}",
                "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.depositor_name_placeholder",
                "className": "w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                  }
                }
              },
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "change",
                  "handler": "setState",
                  "params": { "target": "local", "depositorName": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "환불 계좌 (선택 입력) — 가상계좌 입금완료 건의 환불은 PG(토스 등)가 refundReceiveAccount 를 필수로 요구한다. 여기서 미입력이면 관리자 취소 모달에서 다시 받는다. 3필드 중 하나라도 채우면 나머지도 필수(CreateOrderRequest::withValidator 의 required_with).",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "id": "checkout_refund_bank_vbank",
          "props": { "className": "mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800" }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Label",
              "props": { "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2" },
              "text": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_title"
            },
            {
              "comment": "은행 / 계좌번호 2열 → portable 1열 (마크업 구조 변경이므로 responsive 속성 사용, Tailwind breakpoint 금지)",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": { "className": "grid grid-cols-1 gap-3" }
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Select",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "refund_bank_code",
                    "value": "{{_local.refundBankCode ?? ''}}",
                    "options": "{{[{ value: '', label: $t('shop.checkout.refund_bank_select') }, ...((paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.banks ?? []).map(b => ({ value: b.code, label: $localized(b.name) ?? b.code })))]}}",
                    "className": "w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": {
                        "className": "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": "change",
                      "handler": "setState",
                      "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankCode": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Input",
                  "props": {
                    "type": "text",
                    "name": "refund_bank_account",
                    "value": "{{_local.refundBankAccount ?? ''}}",
                    "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_account_placeholder",
                    "className": "w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": {
                        "className": "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": "change",
                      "handler": "setState",
                      "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankAccount": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Input",
              "props": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "refund_bank_holder",
                "value": "{{_local.refundBankHolder ?? ''}}",
                "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_holder_placeholder",
                "className": "w-full mt-3 px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "w-full mt-3 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                  }
                }
              },
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "change",
                  "handler": "setState",
                  "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankHolder": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "P",
              "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2" },
              "text": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_partial_notice"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "무통장입금 선택 시 계좌 선택 및 입금자명",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{_computed.selectedPaymentMethod === 'dbank'}}",
      "props": { "className": "p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg" },
      "responsive": {
        "portable": {
          "props": { "className": "p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg" }
        }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": { "className": "text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-2" }
            }
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.dbank_info"
        },
        {
          "comment": "계좌 선택",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": { "className": "mb-4" },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Label",
              "props": { "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2" },
              "children": [
                { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:shop.checkout.dbank_select_account" },
                { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "text-red-500 ml-1" }, "text": "*" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "{{_local.errors?.['dbank.bank_code'] ? 'space-y-2 p-2 border-2 border-red-500 rounded-lg' : 'space-y-2'}}" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "iteration": {
                    "source": "{{paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.bank_accounts?.filter(b => b.is_active) ?? []}}",
                    "item_var": "bank",
                    "index_var": "bankIdx"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Button",
                      "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "{{_local.selectedDbank?.bank_code === bank.bank_code ? 'w-full p-3 border-2 border-blue-500 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-lg text-left' : 'w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-left hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}}"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "comment": "라디오 스타일 — 왼쪽에 선택/비선택 동그라미, 오른쪽에 은행명/계좌번호. 결제수단 선택 카드(상단)와 시각적 일관성을 맞추되, 무통장 계좌는 다중 선택 가능성이 있어 명시적 라디오 표시 유지",
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Div",
                          "props": { "className": "flex items-center gap-3" },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "comment": "라디오 아이콘 — 선택: 채워진 체크 동그라미 / 비선택: 빈 동그라미",
                              "type": "basic",
                              "name": "Icon",
                              "props": {
                                "name": "{{_local.selectedDbank?.bank_code === bank.bank_code ? 'circle-check' : 'circle'}}",
                                "iconStyle": "{{_local.selectedDbank?.bank_code === bank.bank_code ? 'solid' : 'regular'}}",
                                "className": "{{_local.selectedDbank?.bank_code === bank.bank_code ? 'text-xl text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0' : 'text-xl text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 flex-shrink-0'}}"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "basic",
                              "name": "Div",
                              "props": { "className": "flex-1" },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "basic",
                                  "name": "P",
                                  "props": { "className": "font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white" },
                                  "text": "{{$localized(bank.bank_name) || bank.bank_code}}"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "basic",
                                  "name": "P",
                                  "props": { "className": "text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400" },
                                  "text": "{{bank.account_number}} ({{bank.account_holder}})"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "actions": [
                        {
                          "type": "click",
                          "handler": "setState",
                          "params": { "target": "_local.selectedDbank", "value": "{{bank}}" }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Span",
              "if": "{{_local.errors?.['dbank.bank_code']}}",
              "props": { "className": "text-red-500 text-xs mt-1 block" },
              "text": "{{_local.errors?.['dbank.bank_code']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "입금자명 입력",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": { "className": "mt-4" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "mt-3" }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Label",
              "props": { "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1" },
              "children": [
                { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "$t:shop.checkout.depositor_name" },
                { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "text-red-500 ml-1" }, "text": "*" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Input",
              "props": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "depositor_name",
                "value": "{{_local.depositorName ?? _computed.ordererDefaults?.name ?? ''}}",
                "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.depositor_name_placeholder",
                "className": "{{_local.errors?.depositor_name ? 'w-full px-4 py-2 border-2 border-red-500 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500' : 'w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500'}}"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "{{_local.errors?.depositor_name ? 'w-full px-3 py-2 border-2 border-red-500 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 text-sm' : 'w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm'}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "change",
                  "handler": "setState",
                  "params": { "target": "local", "depositorName": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Span",
              "if": "{{_local.errors?.depositor_name}}",
              "props": { "className": "text-red-500 text-xs mt-1 block" },
              "text": "{{_local.errors?.depositor_name?.[0] ?? ''}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "환불 계좌 (선택 입력) — 무통장은 PG 를 경유하지 않아 관리자가 수동 이체한다. 여기 입력된 계좌가 그 대상이다. 3필드 중 하나라도 채우면 나머지도 필수(CreateOrderRequest::withValidator 의 required_with).",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "id": "checkout_refund_bank_dbank",
          "props": { "className": "mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600" }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Label",
              "props": { "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2" },
              "text": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_title"
            },
            {
              "comment": "은행 / 계좌번호 2열 → portable 1열 (마크업 구조 변경이므로 responsive 속성 사용, Tailwind breakpoint 금지)",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": { "className": "grid grid-cols-1 gap-3" }
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Select",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "refund_bank_code",
                    "value": "{{_local.refundBankCode ?? ''}}",
                    "options": "{{[{ value: '', label: $t('shop.checkout.refund_bank_select') }, ...((paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.banks ?? []).map(b => ({ value: b.code, label: $localized(b.name) ?? b.code })))]}}",
                    "className": "w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": {
                        "className": "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": "change",
                      "handler": "setState",
                      "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankCode": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Input",
                  "props": {
                    "type": "text",
                    "name": "refund_bank_account",
                    "value": "{{_local.refundBankAccount ?? ''}}",
                    "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_account_placeholder",
                    "className": "w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
                  },
                  "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                      "props": {
                        "className": "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": "change",
                      "handler": "setState",
                      "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankAccount": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Input",
              "props": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "refund_bank_holder",
                "value": "{{_local.refundBankHolder ?? ''}}",
                "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_holder_placeholder",
                "className": "w-full mt-3 px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "w-full mt-3 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                  }
                }
              },
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "change",
                  "handler": "setState",
                  "params": { "target": "local", "refundBankHolder": "{{$event.target.value}}" }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "P",
              "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2" },
              "text": "$t:shop.checkout.refund_bank_partial_notice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "현금영수증 신청 폼 확장 슬롯 — 이커머스 모듈이 resources/extensions/checkout_cash_receipt.json 으로 주입한다. 슬롯이 dbank 블록 내부에 있으므로 결제수단이 무통장일 때만 렌더되며 별도 if 가 필요 없다. 발급 프로바이더는 PG 플러그인이 담당하지만 신청 폼 자체는 PG 비종속이라 모듈이 소유한다(플러그인이 주입하면 두 PG 동시 활성 시 폼이 2개 렌더된다). 주입된 폼은 _local.checkoutExtraPayload 에 자기 필드를 써야 주문 생성 payload 에 실린다 — _checkout_summary.json 의 body 확장 병합 칸 참조.",
          "type": "extension_point",
          "name": "shop_checkout_cash_receipt_slot",
          "default": []
        },
        {
          "comment": "입금 기한 안내 — 가상계좌 안내와 동일 규칙(서버 resolveAutoCancelDays 일치). 빈 문자열/0/음수/비숫자는 기본치 3 으로 되돌린다.",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": { "className": "text-xs text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mt-3" },
          "text": "$t:shop.checkout.dbank_due_notice|days={{Number(paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.auto_cancel_days) > 0 ? Number(paymentSettings.data?.order_settings?.auto_cancel_days) : 3}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
